  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving the livelihoods of handicraft workers in the outer islands of Tonga</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will facilitate the transportation of tools for making handicrafts to 315 members of the association based in the outer island groups (Vava&apos;u, Ha&apos;apai and &apos;Eua). They will also receive training on the use, storage and maintenance of the tools. This will allow beneficiaries to have a sustainable independent income.</narrative>
  </description>
